@ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5038

### 1. Get a test token (Development, or when Auth:EnableTestTokenEndpoint=true) — defaults to OP-777 / Spreader_01
# @name auth
GET {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/generate-test-token
Accept: application/json

### 1b. Mint a token for a different operator / line (positive-case demo for Spreader_02)
GET {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/generate-test-token?operator=OP-901&line=Spreader_02
Accept: application/json

### 2. Fetch a cutting job + its rolls from the database (seeded: CJ-9920 -> Spreader_01)
GET {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/cutting-job/CJ-9920
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Unknown job -> expect 404
GET {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/cutting-job/CJ-0000
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Accept: application/json

### 2c. BOLA on read: CJ-9921 is routed to Spreader_02, token is Spreader_01 -> expect 403
GET {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/cutting-job/CJ-9921
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Submit telemetry for a roll on the operator's own job (includes a mass-assignment probe)
POST {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/spreader-telemetry?lineID=Spreader_01
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuttingJobNo": "CJ-9920",
  "rollID": "R-1045",
  "actualPlyHeight": 50,
  "endBit": 1.5,
  "overlapStart": 2.0,
  "overlapEnd": 2.0,
  "damage": 0.0,
  "UserRole": "Admin"
}

### 3b. Roll not assigned to the job (also the SQL-injection probe target) -> expect 400
POST {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/spreader-telemetry?lineID=Spreader_01
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuttingJobNo": "CJ-9920",
  "rollID": "' OR 1=1; DROP TABLE SpreaderTelemetry; --",
  "actualPlyHeight": 50
}

### 4. Duplicate submission of step 3 -> expect 409 Conflict
POST {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/spreader-telemetry?lineID=Spreader_01
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuttingJobNo": "CJ-9920",
  "rollID": "R-1045",
  "actualPlyHeight": 50
}

### 5. BOLA on write: hand-crafted POST for CJ-9921 (Spreader_02) with a Spreader_01 token -> expect 403
POST {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/spreader-telemetry?lineID=Spreader_02
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuttingJobNo": "CJ-9921",
  "rollID": "R-2050",
  "actualPlyHeight": 50
}

### 5b. Parameter tampering: own job, but ?lineID altered -> expect 400 (consistency, not 403)
POST {{ApparelMiddlewareGateway_HostAddress}}/api/Telemetry/spreader-telemetry?lineID=Spreader_02
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuttingJobNo": "CJ-9920",
  "rollID": "R-1046",
  "actualPlyHeight": 50
}
